---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Faith Forward Content Creation"
  description="Brave for Good produces godly, character-building content for children. Our first piece is Iggy and Mr. Kirk, a modern-day Mr. Rogers' Neighborhood starring Kirk Cameron."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="bg-brand-navy text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-20">
      <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-brand-gold text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em]">Brave for Good Programs</p>
          <h1 class="mt-4 text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold leading-tight">
            Faith Forward Content Creation
          </h1>
          <div class="mt-5 w-14 h-0.5 bg-brand-gold"></div>
          <p class="mt-6 text-lg text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            At BRAVE For Good, we recognize the power of stories. We want to see a world where children
            can be enveloped by godly, character-building content, so we make it ourselves.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            Our first piece is <em>Iggy and Mr. Kirk</em>, a modern-day Mr. Rogers' Neighborhood starring
            Kirk Cameron. Now distributed on many different platforms, <em>Iggy and Mr. Kirk</em> has
            quickly become a household favorite among children today, and it is making an impact.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-8">
            <a href="/support" class="btn-primary">Support the Work</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/images/iggy-wish-group.webp"
            alt="The Brave for Good team with Kirk Cameron, the Make-A-Wish family, and Make-A-Wish staff on the treehouse set"
            class="w-full block"
            loading="eager"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Make-A-Wish story -->
  <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-brand-cream">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-rust mb-3">
          In Partnership with Make-A-Wish
        </p>
        <h2 class="section-heading">A Little Boy's Dream Come True</h2>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            In partnership with the Make-A-Wish Foundation, we made a little boy's dream come true with
            his visit to the <em>Iggy and Mr. Kirk</em> treehouse.
          </p>
          <p>
            He is facing a life-threatening illness, and <em>Iggy and Mr. Kirk</em> has helped lift his
            spirit and endure the therapies needed to improve his quality of life.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- All three photos are portrait, so a level 3-up reads better than a stacked pair. -->
      <div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/images/iggy-wish-arrival.webp"
            alt="A young Make-A-Wish recipient arriving at the Iggy and Mr. Kirk treehouse to a red carpet and confetti with his family"
            class="w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover block"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/images/iggy-kirk-puppets.webp"
            alt="Kirk Cameron and the Iggy and Mr. Kirk cast with their puppet characters on the treehouse set"
            class="w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover block"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-xl overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/images/iggy-wish-hospital.webp"
            alt="The Make-A-Wish recipient resting with his Iggy plush during treatment"
            class="w-full aspect-[4/5] object-cover block"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-14 bg-brand-navy text-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6">
        <div class="max-w-xl">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold">Help Us Make More Stories Like This</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
            Every episode, every visit, and every plush in a hospital bed is funded by people who believe
            children deserve better stories.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="shrink-0 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <a href="/support" class="btn-primary text-center">Donate</a>
          <a href="/programs" class="btn-secondary border-white text-white hover:bg-white hover:text-brand-navy text-center">
            All Programs
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
